        "content": "**AVAILABLE** = all GPUs free + CPU <25%  \u00b7  **HAS CAPACITY** = some GPUs free + CPU <25%  \u00b7  **CPU BUSY** = GPUs free + CPU \u226525%  \u00b7  **IN USE** = no free GPUs\n\n**CPU ONLY** = GPU monitoring disabled  \u00b7  **METRICS MISSING** = server online but GPU status unavailable  \u00b7  **OFFLINE** = node telemetry unavailable",
